msgstr ""
":ref:`自动任务中的相机控制 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-"
"planner>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:65
#: 447f5d705dce46a79f7c01558a35a9d2 696b3f71172742108357cff79985a42c
