":ref:`Mission Commands <common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:69
#: 23c007c0132042f4aae528f35d6b7727 3ee1c02cf3484b97a8a696981f8a5ed5
#: 422749684dbe456a80149a07be03be3e 7cab52f3061a4dc6b3daaa9404f7f9cf
#: f6b740175c504ea7a628e8748f91ae68
msgid "Control from a Companion Computer or MAVLink"
msgstr "通过伴侣电脑或 MAVLink 控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:71
#: 0e9a79cd0ac94912b7c15b1ca9dc43e9 27b0fca3aea842089f6216a4766bbb86
#: 49a529b4808e4b1992cb58c29228fc37 53435d613ec1469d9be6f609a22c2124
#: 73571cf214b94d8a949c23833cfc879d
msgid ""
"Cameras and mounts may also be controlled via MAVLink commands from a "
"companion computer or other source. See :ref:`dev:mavlink-camera`  and "
":ref:`dev:mavlink-gimbal-mount` documentation."
msgstr ""
"相机和云台也可通过伴侣电脑或其他来源的 MAVLink 命令控制。请参阅 :ref:`dev:mavlink-camera` 和 "
":ref:`dev:mavlink-gimbal-mount` 文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:57
#: 4223057f824f41c098471d808dd9fc6a 8a449d775c744a6abdf574edc51dde6a
#: eb0186d1494546ff867b63213084f318 f32f831aa00847b8bd329a36c78ab683
msgid ""
"Note that these buttons are \"edge triggered\" which means that to trigger a"
" function multiple times you may need to push the \"Low\" or \"Mid\" button "
"between pushes of \"High\"."
msgstr "注意这些按钮是“边沿触发”的，也就是说，要多次触发某个功能，可能需要在多次按“High”之间按一下“Low”或“Mid”按钮。"
